    <title>Sticky soy sauce salmon rice bowl</title>
    <updated>2026-06-20T16:10:13.035192+00:00</updated>
    <content type="html">&lt;h1 style="text-align:center;font-family:sans-serif;"&gt;Sticky soy sauce salmon rice bowl&lt;/h1&gt;
        &lt;br&gt;
        &lt;img src="https://www.strangerfoods.org/images/sticky-soy-sauce-salmon-rice-bowl.webp" style="text-align:center;"/&gt;
        &lt;br&gt;
        &lt;p style="font-family:sans-serif;&gt;A salmon rice bowl is a go-to in our house. It is an easy dinner that changes every time I make it depending on the ingredients I have to hand. I keep the skin on the salmon fillets as it gives extra texture and because the skin holds additional nutrients.&lt;/p&gt;</content>
